          + ({h_r}^2-{h_l}^2 ) f(x) }{ {h_r} {h_l}^2 + {h_r}^2 {h_l} }

.. note::
    We estimate the gradient of functions in complex domain
    :math:`g : \mathbb{C}^n \rightarrow \mathbb{C}` in the same way.

