.. math::
    f'(x) \approx \frac{ {h_l}^2 f(x+h_r) - {h_r}^2 f(x-h_l)
          + ({h_r}^2-{h_l}^2 ) f(x) }{ {h_r} {h_l}^2 + {h_r}^2 {h_l} }

.. note::
